{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55453","headline":"拟寒山 十 · 泰钦","name":"拟寒山 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飒飒西风起，飘飘细雨飞。\n前村孤岭上，樵父拥蓑归。\n蹑履寻荒径，搘筇似力微。\n时人应笑我，笑我者还稀。\n（《卍续藏经》本宋释子昇、如佑编《禅门诸祖师偈颂》卷上之上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"泰钦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}